# Line endings are LF in the index *and* in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Not a style preference. `packages/tokens/theme.css` and the generated sections
# of `docs/DESIGN.md` are compared byte-for-byte against what the generator
# emits, and the committed golden snapshots are diffed as text. Without this,
# a Windows checkout rewrites every file to CRLF and those checks fail on
# content that is identical — which is exactly how the Windows `unit` job went
# red the first time a generated artifact was committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts must never be touched by that normalisation.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
